WHAT THIS REPOSITORY CONTAINS
-----------------------------

Measurements and specifications written by hand, plus the small guard script
that keeps forbidden material out of the tree.

It contains no game code, no game assets, no cryptographic keys, no firmware
and no save files. Container layout descriptions are facts derived from
observation; the prose describing them is ours.


UPSTREAM ATTRIBUTION
--------------------

PokoHex (https://github.com/berichan/PokoHex, GPL-3.0) is an independent save
editor for the same game. It is cited here as prior work and as the starting
point for the container reader. Nothing in this repository is copied from it:
where its source is referenced, it is cited by file and line so anyone can
check it against upstream.

Conversations that seeded findings may also involve people in the Pokopia
modding community; their input is credited in the documents where it applies.


